olgende 2 Stufen tiefer), die Edition orientiert sich an ((Pa 1871-106-6)).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-a367db77-a9d4-409e-93ae-8354b905b70d" endid="#m-a367db77-a9d4-409e-93ae-8354b905b70d" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((Et)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((Haec)), alternative Emendation: ((Hac)) (wie ((Pa 1871-106-6))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-78041164-fbc2-4a7e-a962-e6c8555ff6e6" endid="#m-621903a0-69f2-4ba9-8a74-0ea6be62224b" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((superna)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((supernam))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-62a0a315-d232-4e87-8eb3-398ce95d892b" endid="#m-38272c54-f24a-4370-9b0a-0145b95bd17d" type="emendation" corresp="#m-comment-6"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>(vgl. 9a)</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-6-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(alles Folgende eine Stufe tiefer).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-450e6e31-71c9-41e4-a7f9-08129fd2d025" endid="#m-8d7ea744-130d-45c6-b55f-6c2a4b16c784" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((te rogat)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((terrogat))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-38806d82-da3d-4af3-aaad-fcb198f09d96" endid="#m-9f57a226-c24b-4369-a92f-bf8bf84d261e" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((sonora)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((sonorat))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c12e5a8a-0919-4a57-becc-f8ff18b464a5" endid="#m-4ba2771c-1f5f-41c1-8d3f-3cf8bd05f087"><table><tr><td><rend>((&lt;A&gt;llelvia))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Initiale nicht ausgeführt.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-243448bd-6536-4874-970d-8b2fc4432359" endid="#m-bcbb36ab-c71d-4be3-b55b-2ae3bc2903ba"><table><tr><td><rend>((suma))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((summa))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f7a56d16-a3df-419f-b853-a3e0a480c3eb" endid="#m-f7a56d16-a3df-419f-b853-a3e0a480c3eb"><table><tr><td><rend>((At))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Initiale nicht ausgeführt, aber Repräsentant vorhanden.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-7f05fa96-fb6a-46b9-9f44-683d4ce1b6be" endid="#m-6bfa2220-6a47-4538-93f8-28725dbde9fa" corresp="#m-comment-12"><table><tr><td><ptr target="#m-comment-12-notes-0"/></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>korrigiert aus</rend></td><td><ptr target="#m-comment-12-notes-1"/></td><td><rend>(vgl. 12).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Die Edition folgt mit der Einordung der Melodie auf Finalis ((G)) der Überlieferung von Notkers ((Haec est sollempnitas sollempnitatum)); dort erscheint in 1-3 ein b molle, ab 5 b durum. Das scheint dem melodischen Befund auch der aquitanischen Handschriften am besten zu entsprechen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1338"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1338</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1338-18-6</identifier><title>Sollemnitas cunctis</title><incip><incipText><p>Sollemnitas cunctis</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="18">f. 18, l. 6</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 53, 170</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Sequenz</term><term type="genre">Textiert</term><term type="feast">Iohannes Evangelista</term><term type="Editor">Andreas Pfisterer</term><term type="Endseite">19v</term><term type="Endzeile">2</term><term type="Melodie_Standard">Virgo plorans</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1338</identifier><identifier type="can